        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>行列式、转置矩阵与可逆矩阵笔记</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 24px;\n      background: #d4d2cb;\n      color: #262823;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Kaiti SC\", serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: min(760px, 100%);\n      min-height: 1050px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 31px 39px 36px 72px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border: 1px solid #aaa99f;\n      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);\n      background-color: #efefe9;\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(\n          to right,\n          transparent 0,\n          transparent 50px,\n          rgba(151, 98, 98, 0.23) 51px,\n          transparent 52px\n        ),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to bottom,\n          transparent 0,\n          transparent 30px,\n          rgba(92, 115, 123, 0.25) 31px,\n          transparent 32px\n        );\n    }\n\n    .page::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      background: linear-gradient(\n        90deg,\n        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.025),\n        transparent 8%,\n        transparent 91%,\n        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.035)\n      );\n    }\n\n    .section {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      margin-bottom: 11px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 31px;\n    }\n\n    .heading {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      gap: 8px;\n      min-height: 31px;\n    }\n\n    .number {\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .text {\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .formula {\n      min-height: 31px;\n      margin-left: 41px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .formula.center {\n      margin-left: 81px;\n    }\n\n    .formula.deep {\n      margin-left: 120px;\n    }\n\n    .note {\n      margin-left: 19px;\n    }\n\n    .star-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 24px 1fr 1fr 0.8fr;\n      column-gap: 18px;\n      align-items: center;\n      min-height: 31px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .star-row.three {\n      grid-template-columns: 24px 1fr 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .star {\n      font-size: 20px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .definition {\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n\n    .proof {\n      margin-left: 40px;\n    }\n\n    .inverse-layout {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(330px, 1fr) 160px;\n      gap: 17px;\n      align-items: start;\n      margin-top: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .adjugate {\n      min-height: 126px;\n    }\n\n    .matrix-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 11px;\n      min-height: 94px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .matrix-note {\n      margin-top: -4px;\n      padding-left: 92px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 22px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .example {\n      padding-top: 1px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 26px;\n      text-align: center;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .example-matrices {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .side-note {\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      line-height: 21px;\n      transform: rotate(-3deg);\n    }\n\n    .derivation {\n      margin-top: 1px;\n      margin-left: 39px;\n    }\n\n    .properties {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;\n      column-gap: 65px;\n      margin-left: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .properties > div {\n      min-height: 31px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .spacer {\n      height: 4px;\n    }\n\n    mjx-container {\n      margin: 0 !important;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 680px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 0;\n        background: #efefe9;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        width: 100%;\n        min-width: 620px;\n        margin: 0;\n        border: 0;\n        box-shadow: none;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [[\"$\", \"$\"], [\"\\\\(\", \"\\\\)\"]],\n        displayMath: [[\"$$\", \"$$\"], [\"\\\\[\", \"\\\\]\"]]\n      },\n      svg: {\n        fontCache: \"global\"\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">\n        <span class=\"number\">4.</span>\n        <span class=\"text\">两个 $n$ 阶方阵乘积的行列式等于行列式的乘积</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula\">$|AB|=|A||B|$</div>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        ❧　设 $A_1,A_2,\\cdots,A_m$ 为 $n$ 阶方阵，则\n        $\\left|A_1A_2\\cdots A_m\\right|=|A_1||A_2|\\cdots|A_m|$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        推论：若 $A$ 为 $n$ 阶方阵，则 $|kA|=k^n|A|$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula center\">\n        例：$A,B$ 均为 $n$ 阶方阵，$|A|=a\\ne0$，若 $AB+2E=0$，求 $|B|$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula center\">\n        $|AB|=|A||B|=a|B|=|-2E|=(-2)^n$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula deep\">\n        $\\therefore\\ |B|=(-2)^n\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{a}$\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">\n        <span class=\"number\">5.</span>\n        <span class=\"text\">转置矩阵记为 $A^T$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"star-row\">\n        <span class=\"star\">☆</span>\n        <span>定理　$(A^T)^T=A$</span>\n        <span>$(A+B)^T=A^T+B^T$</span>\n        <span>$|A|=|A^T|$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"star-row three\">\n        <span></span>\n        <span>$(kA)^T=kA^T$</span>\n        <span>$(AB)^T=B^TA^T$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"definition\">\n        若 $A^T=A$，则 $A$ 为对称矩阵；若 $A^T=-A$，则 $A$ 为反对称矩阵\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">\n        <span class=\"number\">6.</span>\n        <span class=\"text\">可逆矩阵　有 $n$ 阶方阵 $A,B$，使 $AB=E=BA$，则称 $A$ 为可逆矩阵，$B$ 为 $A$ 的逆矩阵</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"definition\">\n        逆矩阵是唯一的，$A$ 的逆矩阵记为 $A^{-1}$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"proof\">\n        证明：$\\because\\quad AB=E=BA\\qquad AC=E=CA$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"formula center\">\n        $B=BE=B(AC)=(BA)C=EC=C$\n        <span style=\"margin-left:55px;\">$=$ 所有矩阵</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"inverse-layout\">\n        <div class=\"adjugate\">\n          <div class=\"matrix-row\">\n            <span class=\"star\">☆</span>\n            <span>$A^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{|A|}A^*$</span>\n            <span>\n              $A^*=\n              \\begin{bmatrix}\n                A_{11} & A_{21} & \\cdots & A_{n1}\\\\\n                A_{12} & A_{22} & \\cdots & A_{n2}\\\\\n                \\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\\n                A_{1n} & A_{2n} & \\cdots & A_{nn}\n              \\end{bmatrix}$\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"matrix-note\">伴随矩阵　每个位置放代数余子式再转置</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <aside class=\"example\">\n          <div class=\"example-matrices\">\n            <span>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{bmatrix}$</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"example-matrices\">\n            <span>$A^*=\\begin{bmatrix}d&-b\\\\-c&a\\end{bmatrix}$</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"side-note\">对角线，交换位置<br>其余变号</div>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"star-row three\">\n        <span class=\"star\">☆</span>\n        <span>$A\\cdot A^*=|A|\\cdot E=A^*\\cdot A$</span>\n        <span></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"derivation\">\n        推：$\\dfrac{1}{|A|}A^*A=E$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"star-row three\">\n        <span class=\"star\">#</span>\n        <span>$|A|\\ne0$，则 $|A^*|\\ne0$</span>\n        <span>$|A^*|=|A|^{\\,n-1}$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        $A$ 可逆　$\\Longleftrightarrow\\ |A|\\ne0$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">\n        <span class=\"text\">性质：</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"properties\">\n        <div>$|A^{-1}|=|A|^{-1}$</div>\n        <div>$(A^T)^{-1}=(A^{-1})^T$</div>\n\n        <div>$(A^{-1})^{-1}=A$</div>\n        <div>$(AB)^{-1}=B^{-1}A^{-1}$</div>\n\n        <div></div>\n        <div>$(kA)^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{k}A^{-1}$</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
